  "message": "<div style=\"max-width:36rem;width:100%;margin:0 auto;box-sizing:border-box;color:#374151;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:2.05;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.85rem;padding:0;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a365d;line-height:1.6;\">palpable</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.35rem;padding:0;\">발음: <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:#ffe566;\">/ˈpæl.pə.bəl/</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.85rem;padding:0;\">adjective: <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:#ffe566;\">명백한, 확연한, 만져서 느낄 수 있는</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.35rem;padding:0;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">palpable sense</span>: 명백한 느낌</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.35rem;padding:0;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">palpable tension</span>: 명백히 느껴지는 긴장</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.35rem;padding:0;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">palpable relief</span>: 확연한 안도감</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.55rem;padding:0;\">📌 의미: <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:#ffe566;\">so obvious that it can easily be seen or known, or (of a feeling) so strong that it seems as if it can be touched or physically felt</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 1rem;padding:0;\">→ <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:#ffe566;\">palpable</span>은 명백한, 확연한, 만져서 느낄 수 있는을 의미함. <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">palpable sense</span>, <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">palpable tension</span> 형태로 자주 사용됨.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.45rem;padding:0;font-weight:700;color:#1a365d;\">예문 1</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.2rem;padding:0;\">There was a <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">palpable</span> sense of relief when the exam was finally over.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.85rem;padding:0;color:#4b5563;\">시험이 드디어 끝났을 때 확연한 안도감이 있었다.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.45rem;padding:0;font-weight:700;color:#1a365d;\">예문 2</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.2rem;padding:0;\">The tension in the room was <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">palpable</span> as we waited for the results.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.85rem;padding:0;color:#4b5563;\">결과를 기다리는 동안 방 안의 긴장감이 명백히 느껴졌다.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.45rem;padding:0;font-weight:700;color:#1a365d;\">예문 3</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.2rem;padding:0;\">Her disappointment was <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">palpable</span> when she heard the news.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.85rem;padding:0;color:#4b5563;\">그녀가 그 소식을 들었을 때 그녀의 실망감은 확연했다.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.45rem;padding:0;font-weight:700;color:#1a365d;\">예문 4</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.2rem;padding:0;\">There was <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">palpable</span> excitement in the air before the concert started.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.85rem;padding:0;color:#4b5563;\">콘서트가 시작되기 전 공기 중에 확연한 흥분이 있었다.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.55rem;padding:0;\">💡 핵심 뉘앙스:</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:#ffe566;\">palpable</span> → 명백한, 확연한, 만져서 느낄 수 있는을 의미하며, <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">obvious</span>, <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">clear</span>, <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;padding:0.06em 0.2em;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,229,102,0.72);border-bottom:2.5px solid #f0b429;\">evident</span> 등과 유사한 의미로 사용됩니다.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.85rem 0 0;padding:0;\"><strong>유의어:</strong> obvious, clear, evident, tangible, noticeable, perceptible</p>\n</div>",
